@startuml
' Figure 27.4  Handoffs with state (sequence)
' Reading order: top to bottom. The lead offers the case with its state;
' the receiver accepts by taking the stick in its own name; when the
' acknowledgment is lost the lead reads the stick instead of guessing.
' From topology.handoff.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Lead" as L <<model>>
participant "Receiver" as R <<model>>
participant "Stick" as K <<evidence>>
L -> R : Offer with state
R -> K : Take, own name
R -[$FAIL]> L : Ack lost
L -> K : Who holds it?
K --> L : Receiver
@enduml
